    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Rare</em></p><p>A <em>Mechanical Wonder</em> is a semi-autonomous object filled with magical power. Wonders come in many sizes and shapes, depending on what they were built to do.</p><p>A wonder lies dormant until it is activated. To activate it, you wind it with the handheld key made for that wonder alone. Winding takes 1 minute, during which you must take the Utilize action on each of your turns. Once wound, the wonder stays active for the duration given in its description.</p><p><strong>Gyrocopter Wonder.</strong> This wagon-sized vehicle of brassy metal has a spiral propeller mounted on top, and its midsection is open on two sides. Once wound, it stays active for 8 hours, during which it can be used as a vehicle that needs one pilot.</p><p>The gyrocopter is a Huge object that weighs 500 pounds, with AC 14, 50 Hit Points, a Speed of 5 feet, and a Fly Speed of 20 feet. It can carry up to 2,000 pounds of cargo; if it carries more, it shuts down.</p><p>Eight spectral cords are fixed inside its cargo bay. A creature riding in the gyrocopter can take a Utilize action to clip itself to one of the cords or unclip itself. A creature clipped to a cord can jump from the gyrocopter and glide, moving up to 5 feet horizontally for every 1 foot it descends. If a clipped creature ever ends up more than 500 feet away from the gyrocopter, its cord vanishes at once and returns to the wonder.</p>",
